    "socratic_close": "Mechie Socratic discussion mbara na return na main nkuzi lee.",
    "socratic_expand": "Expand Socratic discussion mbara na full lee maka deeper engagement.",
    "wizard_back_results_btn": "Return na chọọ nsonaazụ na họrọ otu different ọkwa.",
    "wizard_close_btn": "Mechie setup onye nduzi. gị ọganihu bụ echekwala na gị nwere ike resume later.",
