      "myth68_1_why": "Ozugbo ọ hapụrụ cannon, naanị force bụ gravity na-adọrọ kpọmkwem ala. Forward motion na-aga n'ihu n'ihi na ọ dịghị ihe na-akwụsị ya — Newton's first law.",
