      "physics_ammeter_how": "Na-atụ current site na ịchọpụta magnetic field nke electrons na-eru na-emepụta. E jikọrọ ya na series ka current niile gafee site na ya. Internal resistance ya dị ala nke ukwuu.",
      "physics_ammeter_analogy": "Dị ka ọnụ ụzọ na-atụgharị nke na-agụ mmadụ ole na-agafe kwa sekọnd.",
      "physics_voltmeter_how": "Na-atụ ọdịiche ọnọdụ (voltage) n'etiti ebe abụọ. E jikọrọ ya parallel na internal resistance dị elu nke ukwuu ka ọ ghara imetụta circuit.",
      "physics_voltmeter_analogy": "Dị ka gauge nrụgide na ọkpọkọ mmiri - na-atụ nrụgide na-akwụsịghị mmiri na-eru.",
      "physics_capacitor_how": "Mbadamba igwe abụọ nke insulator kewara. Electrons na-agbakọ n'otu mbadamba ma hapụ nke ọzọ, na-echekwa ike na electric field. Ha na-ewepụta ike ngwa ngwa mgbe a na-ebufe.",
      "physics_capacitor_analogy": "Dị ka tankị mmiri - ọ na-eju nwayọọ nwayọọ ma nwee ike iwepụ mmiri niile echekwara n'otu oge.",
