      "fraction_vocabulary": "📖 Okwu nkebi",
      "definitions_of_every_fraction_term_use": "Nkọwa nke okwu nkebi ọ bụla e ji mee nkuzi mgbakọ K-8, nwere ihe atụ. E nwere ike ịchọ ya.",
