      "challenge_complete": "Ọ Emechaala Aṅụrị!",
      "206_bones_support_protection_movement_": "Ọkpụkpụ 206 — nkwado, nchekwa, mmegharị, nchekwa mineral, mmepụta ọbara.",
      "houses_meninges_brain_and_cranial_nerv": "Na-echekwa akpụkpọ ụbụrụ, ụbụrụ na oghere akwara isi. Ebe dị nro n’elu isi nwa na-emechi n’oge ọmụmụ na mbido nwata; isi ihe njikọ ọkpụkpụ isi na-anọkarị ruo mgbe mmadụ toro, ọ bụrụ na ha ejikọta, ọ na-abụ oge dị anya karịa.",
      "ribs_1_12": "Ọgịrịga (1-12)",
