      "6co_6h_o_light_c_h_o_6o_powered_by_chl": "6CO₂ + 6H₂O + ìhè → C₆H₁₂O₆ + 6O₂. Chlorophyll na-akwọ ya. Isi iyi nke imirikiti oxygen ikuku.",
