      "major_3rd_vs_minor_3rd_is_the_single_m": "Nke atọ ukwu megide nke atọ nta bụ ụzọ oghere olu kacha na-agbagwoju anya maka ndị mbido. Akara ncheta: nke atọ ukwu = \"Oh when the saints\", nke atọ nta = \"Greensleeves\". Na-ewu nnụ olu metụtara.",
      "lip_trills_sirens_before_any_sustained": "Ịma jijiji egbugbere ọnụ + ụda mkpu tupu ịbụ abụ ọ bụla dị ogologo. Nkeji 5-10 nke ikpo ọkụ obere ike na-ebelata ihe ize ndụ nke iji akwara olu eme ihe karịa site n'ọkara. Ịwụfe ikpo ọkụ bụ ihe kpatara nke mbụ nke mmerụ olu enwere ike igbochi.",
      "sight_reading_2": "Ịgụ Akara",
      "solf_ge_do_re_mi_letter_names_for_sigh": "Solfège (do-re-mi) ka mma karịa aha mkpụrụedemede maka ịgụ akara n'ihi na nkeji okwu na-edepụta mmekọrịta oghere olu, ọ bụghị naanị akara ọdịda olu. Do na-agagharị ka mma karịa do kwụsiri ike maka egwu ụda.",
      "resonance_lab_discover_your_vocal_tone": "Ụlọ Nyocha Ụda Mkpughe — Chọpụta Agba Olu Gị",
      "two_sliders_throat_openness_and_soft_p": "Ihe mmịfe abụọ — imeghe akpịrị na ibuli elu ọnụ dị nro — na-ejikọta n' àgwà agba olu anọ (bara ụba, na-egbuke egbuke, na-ekpo ọkụ, imi). Enweghị akara, enweghị nkpughe: nwalee, dee, ma kọwaa ihe ị chọpụtara.",
