      "base_10_blocks_ones_tens_hundreds_thou": "Base-10 Blocks — otu, iri, narị, puku",
      "the_whole_point_of_place_value_made_ta": "Ebumnuche niile nke place value emere ka ọ bụrụ ihe A NA-EMETỤ AKA. Otu 10 = iri 1; iri 10 = narị 1; narị 10 = puku 1. Regrouping (carrying / borrowing) na-apụta ìhè mgbe ị ga-eji aka gbanwee blocks.",
      "abacus_4_500_years_of_mental_arithmeti": "Abacus — afọ 4,500 nke mgbakọ n'isi",
      "soroban_japanese_and_suanpan_chinese_a": "A ka na-akụzi Soroban (nke Japan) na Suanpan (nke China) — ndị ọkachamara na-emeri calculators n'ọsọ n'ọtụtụ nsogbu. Rod ọ bụla bụ place value; ọnọdụ beads BỤ ọnụọgụgụ. Site n'ihe a na-emetụ aka ruo n'isi n'ime ọnwa ole na ole.",
      "slide_rule_logarithms_in_your_hand": "Slide Rule — logarithms n'aka gị",
      "how_engineers_multiplied_before_electr": "Otú ndị injinia si abawanye tupu calculators eletrọnik: hazie logarithmic scales, gụọ azịza ya. Apollo 11 (1969) ji slide rules mee mgbakọ orbit. E jiri ihe ọzọ dochie ha naanị mgbe HP-35 pụtara na 1972.",
      "quiz_graded_place_value_arithmetic": "Quiz — place value na arithmetic nwere akara",
      "ccss_1_nbt_2_nbt_3_nbt_4_nbt_progressi": "Usoro CCSS 1.NBT, 2.NBT, 3.NBT, 4.NBT. Usoro concrete-pictorial-abstract (CPA, Bruner 1966) bụ ọkpụkpụ azụ nke curriculum mgbakọ ọ bụla e mere nke ọma nke ụlọ akwụkwọ praịmarị.",
      "ten_frames_the_k_2_number_sense_workho": "Ten Frames — isi ihe nke number sense nke K-2",
      "a_5_by_2_grid_fill_cells_to_show_a_num": "Grid nke 5 na 2. Mejupụta cells iji gosi ọnụọgụgụ. Subitizing (ịmata ozugbo na-agụghị ọnụ) na-eto ebe a. CCSS K.OA.A.4: ajụjụ \"gịnị na-eme 10?\" bụ ọnụ ụzọ nke fluency arithmetic niile na-esote.",
      "two_color_counters_integers_concrete": "Two-Color Counters — integers dị ka ihe a na-emetụ aka",
      "yellow_1_red_1_a_yellow_red_pair_0_a_z": "Odo = +1; uhie = -1. Ụzọ odo + uhie = 0 (\"zero pair\"). Model kacha doo anya maka ịghọta negative numbers na integer arithmetic. CCSS 6.NS.C.5, 7.NS.A.1.",
      "place_value_disks_bridge_to_algorithm": "Place-Value Disks — àkwà mmiri gaa na algorithm",
      "each_disk_labeled_with_its_value_1_10_": "E depụtara uru nke disk ọ bụla (1, 10, 100, 1000). Kpụga disks 10 nke otu ụdị ka ị gbanwee ya maka 1 nke uru na-esote. Àkwà mmiri echiche site na blocks anụ ahụ ruo standard algorithm. CCSS 4.NBT.B.4.",
      "hundreds_chart_count_pattern_and_skip": "Hundreds Chart — gụọ, pattern, na wụfe",
      "a_10x10_grid_of_1_100_click_to_highlig": "Grid 10x10 nke 1-100. Pịa iji mee ka cells nwuo. Skip-count overlays na-ekpughe patterns nke ịba ụba. CCSS 2.NBT.A.2: skip-counting site na 5, 10, 100.",
      "pattern_blocks_fractions_symmetry": "Pattern Blocks — fractions na symmetry",
      "hexagon_trapezoid_rhombus_triangle_squ": "Hexagon, trapezoid, rhombus, triangle, square, rhombus dị warara. Trapezoids 2 = hexagon 1 (ya mere trapezoid 1 = 1/2 nke hexagon). Rhombi 3 = hexagon 1 (ya mere rhombus 1 = 1/3). Triangles 6 = hexagon 1 (ya mere triangle 1 = 1/6).",
      "geoboard_polygons_on_a_peg_grid": "Geoboard — polygons na grid nke pegs",
      "connect_pegs_with_rubber_bands_to_make": "Jikọọ pegs na \"rubber bands\" iji mee polygons. Tụọ perimeter na area. Ngwaọrụ ọdịnala a na-emetụ aka maka plane geometry na Pick's theorem.",
      "cuisenaire_rods_numbers_in_color": "Cuisenaire Rods — ọnụọgụgụ n'agba",
      "belgian_teacher_georges_cuisenaire_195": "Onye nkuzi Belgium Georges Cuisenaire (1952): rods 10, ogologo 1-10, nke ọ bụla nwere agba dị iche. Tinye rods iji mee ọnụọgụgụ ọhụrụ. Ọcha=1, uhie=2, akwụkwọ ndụ dị mfe=3, odo odo=4, odo=5, akwụkwọ ndụ gbara ọchịchịrị=6, oji=7, aja aja=8, anụnụ=9, oroma=10.",
      "number_bonds_part_part_whole": "Number Bonds — part-part-whole",
      "the_whole_splits_into_two_parts_singap": "Ihe zuru oke na-ekewa ụzọ abụọ. Singapore Math mere ka nke a bụrụ isi. CCSS K.OA.A.3: kewaa 10 ka ọ bụrụ ụzọ abụọ abụọ. Nke a na-ewuli ụzọ gaa na mgbakọ na mwepụ niile.",
      "fraction_bars_compare_and_add_fraction": "Fraction Bars — tụnyere ma tinye fractions",
      "equal_length_bars_partitioned_into_hal": "Bars nwere otu ogologo nke e kewara ka ọ bụrụ ọkara, ụzọ atọ, ụzọ anọ, ụzọ isii, ụzọ asatọ, na ụzọ iri na abụọ. Tụkwasa ha iji tụnyere. Chọta ndị hà nhata site n'anya. Ngwaọrụ kachasị dị mma maka fraction equivalence (3.NF, 4.NF).",
      "algebra_tiles_model_expressions_and_eq": "Algebra Tiles — mee model nke expressions na equations",
      "a_tile_for_1_unit_x_variable_x_square_": "Tile maka 1 (unit), x (variable), x² (square). Agba abụọ: positive na negative. Mee model nke expressions dị ka 2x + 3 ma ọ bụ factor quadratics site n'ịhazi tiles ka ọ bụrụ rectangles. CCSS 7.EE, 8.EE.",
      "cra_progression_concrete_picture_equat": "CRA Progression — concrete → foto → equation",
      "bruner_1966_students_master_each_conce": "Bruner (1966): ụmụ akwụkwọ na-amụta concept ọ bụla site n'ịgafe ụzọ atọ nke representation. Anyị na-eduga gị n'otu nsogbu AHỤ n'ụzọ atọ niile ka abstract symbol nwee ntọala n'ihe ị ga-AHỤ ma METỤ AKA.",
      "challenge_hub_quick_practice_across_ev": "Ebe Ịma Aka — omume ngwa ngwa n'ofe manipulative ọ bụla",
      "random_problems_spanning_all_12_manipu": "Nsogbu random gbasara manipulatives 12 niile. E mere ya maka distributed practice (Cepeda et al. 2006): usoro mkpirisi nke nkeji ise, na-agwakọta ụdị, na-emeri nkeji iri abụọ nke otu ụdị n'usoro.",
      "glossary_math_vocabulary_with_examples": "Nkọwa Okwu — okwu mgbakọ, tinyere ihe atụ",
      "vocabulary_is_the_curriculum_a_student": "Okwu BỤ curriculum. Nwa akwụkwọ nụrụ \"regroup,\" \"compose,\" \"decompose,\" \"fluently,\" na \"place value\" ọtụtụ ugboro n'ọnọdụ ga-etinye usoro ahụ n'ime ya. E kegidere nkọwa ọ bụla na manipulative nke na-egosi ya.",
      "brain_teasers_classic_math_puzzles": "Gwam Gwam Gwam — puzzles ọdịnala nke mgbakọ",
      "classic_problems_that_are_solvable_sat": "Nsogbu ọdịnala nwere ngwọta, na-eju afọ, ma na-adịkarị mfe mgbe manipulative dị n'aka. Ha bara uru dị ka warm-up, ọrụ mejupụta oge, ma ọ bụ ọrụ nkwụsi ike maka mkparịta ụka klas.",
      "history_math_tools_through_time": "Akụkọ Ihe Mere Eme — ngwaọrụ mgbakọ n'ime oge",
      "counting_bones_lebombo_35_000_bce_sume": "Ọkpụkpụ ọgụgụ (Lebombo, ~35,000 BCE) → tokens ndị Sumer → abacus ndị Rom → Cuisenaire rods (1952) → taa. Manipulative ọ bụla na ngwaọrụ a bụ akụkụ nke ogologo agbụrụ nke ngwá nkuzi.",
      "curriculum_map_which_tool_which_grade": "Maapụ Curriculum — ngwaọrụ ole, grade ole",
