      "red_dwarf_coolest_most_common_stars_75": "Kpakpando uhie nta — kpakpando kacha jụọ oyi + kacha baa ụba (pasent 75 nke kpakpando niile)",
      "orange_dwarf_quieter_than_sun_longer_l": "Kpakpando nta odo odo — dị jụụ karịa Anyanwụ, na-ebi ogologo",
