      "every_3rd_bite_of_food_you_eat_depends": "Every 3rd bite of food you eat depends on pollinators. Honeybees alone contribute ~$15 billion/year to U.S. agriculture — and that's before counting the 4,000+ native bee species that pollinate wild plants.",
      "every_treatment_has_trade_offs_real_be": "Every treatment has trade-offs. Real beekeepers rotate treatments seasonally to prevent mite resistance. Effectiveness depends on brood status and temperature.",
      "experience_life_as_a_drone_bee_your_so": "Experience life as a drone bee. Fly into the game’s 100–130 ft Drone Congregation Area target and find a queen. Flight time varies by difficulty: 150 / 110 / 75 seconds. Only about 1 in 1,000 drones succeeds in this model — can you?",
