      "ambush_hunters_lurking_in_crevices_the": "Ambush hunters lurking in crevices. They smell prey + strike from cover. Hiding in coral doesn't help — that's WHERE the eel is. Octopus must abandon shelter + flee.",
      "ambush_slow_stalk_strike": "🎭 Ambush — slow stalk + strike",
      "ammonite_fossil_suture_patterns_become": "Ammonite fossil suture patterns become more elaborate over evolutionary time — culminating in fractal-like designs in late Mesozoic species. The suture pattern probably reinforced the shell.",
      "ammonite_reverence": "Ammonite reverence",
      "ammonoid_cephalopods_dominated_the_oce": "Ammonoid cephalopods dominated the oceans for 300 million years before going extinct with the dinosaurs (~66 MYA). They left billions of fossils.",
      "ammonoids_diverge_from_nautiloids_dist": "Ammonoids diverge from nautiloids. Distinctive feature: complex suture lines where shell partitions meet the outer wall, creating zigzag patterns that strengthened the shell against pressure.",
      "among_the_most_venomous_animals_on_ear": "Among the most venomous animals on Earth. Sting causes cardiac arrest within minutes in humans. Australian box jellies kill more people per year than great white sharks. Have 24 eyes (16 simple + 8 image-forming) distributed on their bell.",
