      "the_surface_sand_rock_coral_kelp_an_an": "The surface (sand / rock / coral / kelp) an animal lives on or moves across",
      "the_systemic_heart_stops_beating_durin": "the systemic heart STOPS BEATING during sustained jet swimming",
      "the_takeaway": "🎯 The takeaway",
