      "the_cdc_estimates_antibiotic_resistant": "The CDC estimates antibiotic-resistant infections kill ~35,000 Americans per year. WHO calls antibiotic resistance one of the top 10 public health threats. Every prescription not finished, every antibiotic taken for a viral infection, every drop in livestock feed adds selection pressure.",
      "trait_means_compatibility_over_time": "Trait Means + Compatibility Over Time",
      "visualize_p_2pq_q_1_with_adjustable_al": "Visualize p² + 2pq + q² = 1 with adjustable allele frequencies. Toggle selection / mutation / drift / migration to see equilibrium break.",
