      "your_land_is_divided_into_5_zones_each": "E kewara ala gị ụzọ 7, nke ọ bụla nwere ebe obibi nke ya, ojiji omenala nke ya, na oge ọkụ ji alaghachi nke ya. ",
      "your_mosaic": "Your mosaic",
