      "detoxes_superfoods_gluten_free_for_non": "Detoxes, \"superfoods,\" gluten-free for non-celiac, vitamin megadosing, fat-free craze, organic = healthier. NIH and Harvard sourced.",
      "dial_211_or_visit_211maine_org_for_con": "Dial 211 (or visit 211maine.org) for connections to food pantries, SNAP application help, school meal info, and other services. Free, confidential, available 24/7.",
      "dietary_fiber": "Dietary Fiber",
